{"id":195,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"Its body is always slimy. It often bangs its head on the river bottom as it swims but seems not to care."},{"games":["Sword","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It has an easygoing nature. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Quagsire hunts for food by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in unaware. Because the Pokémon does not move, it does not get very hungry."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"This carefree Pokémon has an easygoing nature. While swimming, it always bumps into boat hulls."},{"games":["X","Diamond"],"text":"It has a sluggish nature. It lies at the river’s bottom, waiting for prey to stray into its mouth."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Due to its relaxed and carefree attitude, it often bumps its head on boulders and boat hulls as it swims."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"A dim-witted Pokémon. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head into boats or rocks while swimming."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A QUAGSIRE hunts by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in. Because it doesn’t move, it does not get very hungry."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Damp","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon dampens its surroundings, preventing all Pokémon from using explosive moves such as Self-Destruct."},{"name":"Water Absorb","hidden":false,"description":"If hit by a Water-type move, the Pokémon has its HP restored instead of taking damage."},{"name":"Unaware","hidden":true,"description":"When attacking, the Pokémon ignores the target's stat changes."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":194,"name":"Wooper","condition":null,"children":[{"